---
source: crates/frame-graph/src/describe.rs
expression: described(&graph)
---
batch 0 on graphics
  group 0
    barrier output: acquired -> color-attachment-write
    pass "triangle" (raster)
      render pass: colour output: clear (0.02, 0.05, 0.1, 1), store
  end of frame
    barrier output: color-attachment-write -> present
